    ("BedsheetCaptain", "It has a Nanotrasen symbol on it, and was woven with a revolutionary new kind of thread guaranteed to have 0.01% permeability for most non-chemical substances, popular among most modern captains."),
    ("BedsheetCosmos", "Made from the dreams of those who wonder at the stars."),
    ("BedsheetGreen", "A surprisingly soft linen bedsheet."),
