    ("ClothingEyesGlassesCommand", "Upgraded sunglasses that provide flash immunity and show ID card status."),
    ("ClothingEyesGlassesGar", "Go beyond impossible and kick reason to the curb!"),
    ("ClothingEyesGlassesGarGiga", "We evolve past the person we were a minute before. Little by little we advance with each turn. That's how a drill works!"),
