    ("ClothingNeckCloakMoth", "A cloak in the form of moth wings is an unusual and original element of the wardrobe that can attract the attention of others. It is made of a thin fabric imitating moth wings, with soft and fluffy edges. The raincoat is fastened around the neck with straps, and has a hood in the shape of a moths head."),
