    ("ClothingUniformJumpsuitSec", "A jumpsuit made of strong material, providing robust protection."),
    ("ClothingUniformJumpsuitSecBlue", "I'm a little busy right now, Calhoun."),
    ("ClothingUniformJumpsuitSecGrey", "A tactical relic of years past before Nanotrasen decided it was cheaper to dye the suits red instead of washing out the blood."),
