    ("ClothingUniformJumpsuitVirology", "It's made of a special fiber that gives special protection against biohazards. It has a virologist rank stripe on it."),
    ("ClothingUniformJumpsuitWarden", "A formal security suit for officers complete with Nanotrasen belt buckle."),
    ("ClothingUniformOveralls", "Great for working outdoors."),
