    ("PlushieArachnid", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles an arachnid. It feels silky.."),
    ("PlushieAtmosian", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a brave atmosian. Unfortunately, he won't fix those depressurizations for you."),
    ("PlushieBee", "A cute toy that resembles an even cuter programmer. You'd have to be a monster to grind this up."),
    ("PlushieCarp", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles the monstrous space carp."),
    ("PlushieDiona", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a diona. Love water and cuddles. Do not wet!"),
    ("PlushieExperiment", "A plushie of a canid of sorts. It yearns to be detonated on a landmine."),
    ("PlushieHampter", "A cute stuffed toy that resembles a hamster. Its face looks squished."),
    ("PlushieHolocarp", "A holographic stuffed toy resembling science's nemesis - the holocarp."),
    ("PlushieHuman", "This is a felt plush of a human. All craftsmanship is of the lowest quality. The human is naked. The human is crying. The human is screaming."),
    ("PlushieLamp", "A light emitting friend!"),
    ("PlushieLizard", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson. Made by CentComm as a token initiative to combat speciesism in work environments. \"Welcome your new colleagues as you do this plush, with open arms!\""),
    ("PlushieLizardInversed", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson from an inversed dimension. Hew!"),
    ("PlushieLizardJobAtmospherictechnician", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as an atmospheric technician. Smells faintly of frezon."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobBartender", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a bartender. Its tongue has alcohol stains on it."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobBotanist", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a botanist. There's prickly bits on its feet and it smells faintly of plant fertilizer."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobBoxer", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a boxer. The threads on its gloves are starting to come loose."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobCaptain", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as the captain. There's bits of pie on its face."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobCargotechnician", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a cargo technician. Crumbs of packing peanuts are stuck to its scales."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobChaplain", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a chaplain. It smells faintly of incense."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobChef", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a chef. It smells faintly of spices, with spots of oil on its apron."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobChemist", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a chemist. Parts of the plushie are stained with chemicals."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobChiefengineer", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as the chief engineer. It's covered in metal shavings and welding splatter."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobChiefmedicalofficer", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as the chief medical officer. The plushie's tail has been sewn off and on again, probably from practicing surgery."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobClown", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a clown. Its nose squeaks when you press it."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobDetective", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a detective. Seems ready for a mystery."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobHeadofpersonnel", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as the head of personnel. While it seems thrilled on the outside, it's probably just as bored as you are."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobHeadofsecurity", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as the head of security. It seems to have been ripped and re-stitched a few times."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobJanitor", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a janitor. It smells faintly of cleaning supplies."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobLawyer", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a lawyer. Its lawyer pin is barely hanging on from hours of fidgeting."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobLibrarian", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a librarian. The color of the plushie has faded from years of desk-watching."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobMedicaldoctor", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a medical doctor. Seems to be well-washed."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobMedicalintern", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a medical intern. It smells faintly of antiseptic."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobMime", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a mime. It stares at you silently, its motives unknown."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobMultiweh", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as every job! It's a plushie of many talents. You can hear a HoP crying in the distance."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobMusician", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a musician. It smells faintly of sweat and has a few strings coming loose."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobParamedic", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a paramedic. The plushie has a few little bandages sewn on it."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobPassenger", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a passenger. Its eyes look at you, a little bit more beady than the rest."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobPsychologist", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a psychologist. It seems to like to quietly listen to you."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobQuartermaster", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as the quartermaster. Its covered in sticky residue left behind from thousands of shipment invoices."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobReporter", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a reporter. It smells faintly of ink."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobResearchassistant", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a research assistant. It smells faintly of burnt paper."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobResearchdirector", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as the research director. There's a few burn marks on the plushie."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobSalvagespecialist", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a salvage specialist. Seems like it's seen the coldness of space for a while."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobScientist", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a scientist. There's a few bite marks on the plushie, probably from a curious monkey."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobSecuritycadet", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a security cadet. Seems to have shock marks across the plushie."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobSecurityofficer", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a security officer. The stuffing has been padded down from a lot of punching."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobServiceworker", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a service worker. Smells like a mix of cleaning supplies and food."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobStationengineer", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a station engineer. It has oil stains on its hands."),
    ("PlushieLizardJobTechnicalassistant", "An adorable stuffed toy that resembles a lizardperson as a technical assistant. It smells faintly of burnt wires."),
