    ("TravelCamera", "A picture says more than a thousand words. Comes with an ultrabright flash and internal recharging photo roll."),
    ("TritiumCanister", "A canister that can contain any type of gas. This one is supposed to contain tritium. It can be attached to connector ports using a wrench."),
